Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.86,0:00:22.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 就这样 别急啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.77,0:00:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始啦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:00:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.43,0:01:17.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP:STORMBRINGER\NBy:JAM Project
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:22.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,変幻自在 天魔外道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闇の気配が迫る
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問答無用 情け無用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一気にけりを着けろ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇跡のPower
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怒りのSoul
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:40.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,WOWOW WOWOW
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嵐とともに
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.90,0:01:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷鳴の中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.26,0:01:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,変われ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.56,0:01:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神になれ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.98,0:01:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叩きつけろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,その拳を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打つ砕け!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悪の野望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:02:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暗黒の雲を吹き祓え!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吠えろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来の空へ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,限りない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夢をのせて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:12.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荒れ果てた世界に希望を
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古の神の技に
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熱い勇気を込めて!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.89,0:02:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最強の化身は 立つ!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,字幕制作：(V2,林原萌,Hikaru,Wesley)@X2字幕组\N抄写重调：cavalier@u2.dmhy.org
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:34.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Build Up! 钢铁基克!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:35.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得好\N加油!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.53,0:02:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去的话 将会是Team Siba的一二名之争
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:02:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头位的是高中生骑手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.85,0:02:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美角镜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧跟其后的是同是高中生骑手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草薙剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜 我不会把奖杯让给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:10.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟好了 剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:12.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能超得过我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:21.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害 简直就是镜和剑儿的对决赛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:24.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作为队友的美角镜和草薙剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要这两位进入前三位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据HMB(超级摩托车协会)的规定 该队将成为种子车队
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但下一场比赛中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两人中只能有一位代表车队参赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:44.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时到达
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.07,0:03:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计算到千分之一秒也是同时到达
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.15,0:04:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来是全国天气预报
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.80,0:04:33.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冲绳地区 晴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.26,0:04:35.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中国 四国地区 晴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,位于桥的另一头的应该是九州
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明就在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却是片被我们的世界所遗忘的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在天气预报里已听不到九州的名字了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:55.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝大家出行平安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:17.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,热死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.22,0:05:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.67,0:05:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃啊 痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:29.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切 明明差一点点就能决出胜负了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.40,0:05:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.85,0:05:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:47.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第17号浮标
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.73,0:05:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定又是出故障了 五十年都没有变化的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:56.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 这是...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 船长
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:06.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上通知Build Base
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:12.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新Build Base
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.33,0:06:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自种子岛的数据呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和来自对马,鹿儿岛,下关的数据一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来Zone的活性化反应是没错了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联系总理大臣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时 向各观测所人员传达
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对自动监视系统进行再检测完毕后 撤离Zone周围
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要撤离到哪一带好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 笨蛋 这种事我怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.01,0:06:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联系到官房长官了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:38.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总理大臣人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总理很忙 是有关那个时空吸引体吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.31,0:06:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已确认次溶质地带Zone开始活性化了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去可以预见会出现新的侵蚀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.19,0:06:56.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请求对九州近邻地区发出警戒警报
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:07:01.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,半个多世纪都没有发生什么动静的Zone吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:04.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的情报是否真实可信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:08.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没空在这和你做无用的争论
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:11.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会处理你的请求的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是具体的行动要等到灾害时紧急委员会会议召开后再决定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:18.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那关于Build Base的武装使用方面的许可呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:20.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得到许可了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.11,0:07:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请马上开始阻止Zone扩大的工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是为了这个目的 才赐予Build Base各种权限的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上头不想承担责任 只要在结果上阻止成功就行了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:34.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埴轮(日本远古时代的一种明器陶俑)呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:39.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通常是作为当时的权力者的陪葬品 被我们发掘出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照规矩 由于失去了主人 侍奉其的士兵们就得自绝性命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.35,0:07:46.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陪伴其主公 前往黄泉之国
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:50.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀 好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:55.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而有种说话就是 这种陪葬习惯逐渐演变成由埴轮代替士兵了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:58.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但真实情况则无法知晓的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个叫铜铎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最初的时候就像是神社的吊铃那样是用来鸣响的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但之后逐渐成为了祈祷丰收的仪式中的祭礼之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:12.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来 问大家个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认为邪马台国是在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.01,0:08:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那场战斗的最高潮 神秘的能量覆盖了九州岛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邪魔大王国女王 妃魅祸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊的雾气 在其间造出了一片科技性风暴结界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,形成了一堵任何手段都无法进入其中进行调查的壁垒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就连当时围在Zone四周采取警戒保卫的美国海军
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:30.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也由于十年中毫无动静而撤离
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怜这些滞留在九州的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好比以那天为分界线 音信全无
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.89,0:09:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 你去过那家新开的意大利餐厅吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说那儿的意大利面非常好吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎? 我们一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩 去啊去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.59,0:09:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.45,0:09:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢款待
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住 傻瓜剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.55,0:10:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿好可怜 被色狼傻瓜剑儿纠缠不休
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说是青梅竹马
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从幼时就是一对冤家了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孽缘
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:11.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 也不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有型 镜大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:17.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 镜大人头脑聪明车技超一流
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:19.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在Build Base打工呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管干什么都那么有型
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛啊 真是的 干嘛扔鞋子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 管它呢 吃饭吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认为这种饭菜搭配适合现代人的消费观念
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜 少管我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的打工钱要怎么花不用你管
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的镜大人为什么会和傻瓜剑儿坐一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙只有车技是一流的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长说了 我和你 将决定谁是代表车队的赛车手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 一决高下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放学后 我在测试赛道上等你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终点线归我咯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.15,0:11:22.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 一上来就全力加速吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.65,0:11:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是太轻率了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.43,0:11:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.89,0:11:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地震?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:12:00.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 是 我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 镜 那座秃山崩坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.22,0:12:34.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埴轮幻神 魔愚罗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.72,0:12:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埴轮幻神
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它冲椿所在的神社去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.19,0:13:10.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉眼确认埴轮幻神
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行空对地导弹进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.01,0:13:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:52.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么那头怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然把我们的城市...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:07.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿 你在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:12.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是剑儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:15.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 快点逃命吧 看 看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:22.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙是...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.65,0:14:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酷毙了 这部摩托什么来头啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:52.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,骑着它离开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.05,0:15:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,酷 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老婆婆 坐后座上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.84,0:15:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爽 太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 居然毁了神社
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么追着我不放啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了 是防卫队
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埴轮幻神 依然健在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"鱼叉" 全弹发射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.71,0:16:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到 "鱼叉" 全弹发射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:29.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高能量体 接近
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.45,0:16:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迎击导弹 发射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标无法锁定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.19,0:16:34.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用速射全自动方阵炮 击落它
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 径直冲本舰来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全员做好抗冲击准备
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甩不掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:57.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:02.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里你总追不到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.36,0:17:26.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 没见过那种战斗机
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是新型的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛 管它呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:40.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:01.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标进入废工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将他诱导至塌坡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿 收到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.86,0:18:06.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他几颗麻雀吧(麻雀:中程半主动雷达制导的空对空导弹)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.24,0:18:08.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用火神炮就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么 那些家伙也是敌人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 这个也是那个也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:48.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又来新的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:53.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基克部件
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:09.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有手 还有脚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:16.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿 别逃
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些不是敌人 是你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿 是椿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.44,0:19:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当基克部件接近 雷钢马的磁场差异力场的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会出现Build Up信号
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.87,0:19:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bui Bui?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把两手的拳头合起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:31.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊? 拳头?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:32.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.69,0:19:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.83,0:19:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊 飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手怎么...? 好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.41,0:19:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊 要被压扁了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:37.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人 变成机器人了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是基克
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.95,0:20:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Build Up 确认
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿变成基克了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这小子 同步率协调了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事 这部摩托
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.55,0:20:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是钢铁基克
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.47,0:20:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你谁啊 老头
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.39,0:21:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草薙剑儿 你要成为保护这片大地的守护者
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:04.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:06.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿 危险
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:16.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 好大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.65,0:21:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上啊 基克
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.46,0:21:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么上不上的 别自作主张 老头
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:23.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少废话 你就...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:25.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑儿 战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:28.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用你这份力量打倒埴轮幻神
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,镜 你怎么会...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 之后再给我解释清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不知道发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但别想轻易打垮我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.52,0:22:02.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放马过来吧 埴轮幻神
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.04,0:22:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待续
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ending Theme [HEAVEN]\Nby GRANRODEO
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't let me down Don't leave me now
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:45.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手探りの　in the dark
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.11,0:22:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Right on my way, Light out the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:53.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见失わないように
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.97,0:23:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,キラメキを背にして　立ち上がる君はconfuse
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.97,0:23:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歩き始めるとまどいも 腕に抱えて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:13.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,cause I fly away to heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.47,0:23:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命が见えた 足りない意思の果てに　
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.04,0:23:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,when I find your any reason
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.01,0:23:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁が为に问う stair way to heaven 理想へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.06,0:23:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,登る世界は???yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.03,0:23:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I keep freak out forever
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邪魔大王国
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.78,0:23:48.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椿 镜 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.34,0:23:51.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说 五十年前的战斗还没有结束?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.37,0:23:53.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 在阿苏的地底下?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.39,0:23:56.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,次回 苏醒的妃魅祸! 复活! 邪魔大王国
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.88,0:23:57.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Build Up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
